@startuml
title CropAI System Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor Farmer

package "Presentation Layer" {
  [Landing Page\nindex.html]
  [Auth Pages\nlogin.html / signup.html / verify.html]
  [Dashboard UI\ndashboard.html]
  [Profile UI\nprofile.html]
  [Support & Static Pages]
}

package "Application Layer" {
  [Express Server\nserver.js] as Server
  [Authentication & Session Module]
  [Profile Management Module]
  [Crop Recommendation Engine]
  [Photo Analysis Pipeline]
  [CropAI Assistant / Chat Module]
  [Weather & Market Module]
  [Mailer / Notification Logic]
}

package "Service Layer" {
  [kindwiseClient.js]
  [Google OAuth Verification]
  [SMTP Transport]
  [Image Processing\nmulter + sharp]
}

package "Data Layer" {
  database [MongoDB]
  database [JSON Fallback\nfarmers.json]
  collections [Crop Recommendation Dataset\nCSV + cultivation catalog]
  collections [Session State\nexpress-session memory store]
  folder [Uploaded Images\npublic/uploads]
}

package "External Integrations" {
  cloud [Plant.id API]
  cloud [Kindwise Crop Health API]
  cloud [OpenRouter / LLM APIs]
  cloud [Open-Meteo API]
  cloud [Google Identity]
}

Farmer --> [Landing Page\nindex.html]
Farmer --> [Auth Pages\nlogin.html / signup.html / verify.html]
Farmer --> [Dashboard UI\ndashboard.html]
Farmer --> [Profile UI\nprofile.html]

[Landing Page\nindex.html] --> Server
[Auth Pages\nlogin.html / signup.html / verify.html] --> Server
[Dashboard UI\ndashboard.html] --> Server
[Profile UI\nprofile.html] --> Server
[Support & Static Pages] --> Server

Server --> [Authentication & Session Module]
Server --> [Profile Management Module]
Server --> [Crop Recommendation Engine]
Server --> [Photo Analysis Pipeline]
Server --> [CropAI Assistant / Chat Module]
Server --> [Weather & Market Module]
Server --> [Mailer / Notification Logic]

[Authentication & Session Module] --> [Google OAuth Verification]
[Authentication & Session Module] --> [Session State\nexpress-session memory store]
[Authentication & Session Module] --> [MongoDB]
[Authentication & Session Module] --> [JSON Fallback\nfarmers.json]

[Profile Management Module] --> [MongoDB]
[Profile Management Module] --> [JSON Fallback\nfarmers.json]
[Profile Management Module] --> [Crop Recommendation Dataset\nCSV + cultivation catalog]

[Crop Recommendation Engine] --> [Crop Recommendation Dataset\nCSV + cultivation catalog]
[Crop Recommendation Engine] --> [OpenRouter / LLM APIs]

[Photo Analysis Pipeline] --> [Image Processing\nmulter + sharp]
[Photo Analysis Pipeline] --> [kindwiseClient.js]
[Photo Analysis Pipeline] --> [Uploaded Images\npublic/uploads]

[kindwiseClient.js] --> [Plant.id API]
[kindwiseClient.js] --> [Kindwise Crop Health API]

[CropAI Assistant / Chat Module] --> [OpenRouter / LLM APIs]
[Weather & Market Module] --> [Open-Meteo API]
[Authentication & Session Module] --> [Google Identity]
[Mailer / Notification Logic] --> [SMTP Transport]

[Google OAuth Verification] --> [Google Identity]
[SMTP Transport] --> [Google Identity]

note bottom of Server
Central backend entry point that coordinates:
- auth and sessions
- profile persistence
- recommendation generation
- image analysis
- chat assistant
- weather and market APIs
end note
@enduml
